Based on my analysis of the codebase, I can see that the function should implement the A* pathfinding algorithm. Looking at the RouteModel and RoutePlanner classes, I understand that:

1. The Graph is actually a RouteModel with Node objects
2. Each Node has g_value (distance from start) and h_value (heuristic to end)
3. Nodes have parent pointers to reconstruct the path
